      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Internal first, web second",
      "items": [
        "W7 searches the pinned corpus version, then the allowlisted web",
        "Web finds are labelled unvetted and queued for SME review"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "One image, two entrypoints",
      "items": [
        "W1 to W6 run offline as Dagster steps",
        "W2 to W8 also serve answer-time APIs, W3 code runs in a sandbox"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Local now, AWS later",
      "items": [
